,"sourceWorkId":"13372","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"交通工具的适应性很好，某种天才。大部分的交通工具一握住手把就会很自然地能开动。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她本人在各交通工具中最喜欢摩托车。平常的代行工具是自行组改装摩托『ポピンズ号』。车牌是伪造的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总是情绪高昂，想到什么做什么横冲直撞，经常自爆。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢管闲事，很宠弱者（比自己年小之类的）。爱好仁义，有着不容恶党和无耻之徒的正义感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"信条是「笨猪跳也是塞翁失马」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为经济上合性格上的理由而和恭太郎一起行动。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12281"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14153","sourceWorkId":"13372","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14153","sourceWorkId":"13372","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"159 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14153","sourceWorkId":"13372","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14153","sourceWorkId":"13372","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14153","sourceWorkId":"13372","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e169f0e565840ac7d2357c779b881c5310e5be69143f5310215b48922b45e48d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/99ff776968fda6c803574b316d9e1633e0fb52e31fbe8205aefd69eba63ee206.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ひと美","creatorId":"vndb:s113","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s113","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s113","name":"ひと美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:7189:12281:4675:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c10842","characterName":"市倉 吉佳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12282","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"7189"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14154"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10842"},"originalCharacterName":"市倉 吉佳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"83"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【清楚で可憐、人望も厚い学園のカリスマだけど……】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キーワード：【プリエステス】 【男嫌い】 【清楚？】 【3年生】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見、完璧超人。文武両道で、クラス委員と前年の生徒会にも所属していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女と会話すると、なんとなくそうかも知れないと納得させられるオーラを持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、高度に発達した鋭い乙女の勘を持っており、他者の悪意や敵意に異常なまでに敏感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"絵に描いたようなお嬢様の優等生だが、男嫌い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格的にはいたって常識人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"判断も冷静かつ適正で、一味のツッコミ役。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の弱点である 【男嫌い】 を克服するため、恭太郎と行動を共にする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「メズマの神さまのお導きかもね」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14154","sourceWorkId":"13372","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"咋眼看是完美超人。文武双全，所属于班级委员，还有前年的学生会。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有着和她说话就和很自然地认同她所说的话的特质。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"另外，有着高度发达敏锐的少女直觉，对他人的恶意和敌意异常地敏感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"典型的大小姐优等生，但讨厌男人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格上是极其有常识的人。判断冷静且合理，一伙中负责吐槽的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"为了克服自己的弱点【讨厌男人】，而和恭太郎一起行动。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12282"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14154","sourceWorkId":"13372","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"b","valueC